Notes...about a recent character:

1) Rolling up 10 characters of the same name, role, race, gender and
alignment and then losing them all may be the game's way of telling
you to try something different

2) It does not mean the name you gave them is bad luck

3) Archeologists may be great in the late game, but that doesn't make
them suck less as fighters in the early game

4) Leave that bear trap alone

5) Nymphs carry mirrors; don't to use wands of striking next time

6) I said, DON'T USE WANDS OF STRIKING!!!

7) Minetown is never where you expect it to be

8) Neither are polymorph traps

9) Minetown at level 4 with an AC of 7 and no pets rarely is a Good
Idea

10) Furthermore, one does not announce one's arrival by carelessly
walking into a floating eye

11) Snakes' bites will sometimes be poisoned

12) The poison will sometimes be deadly

13) Amulets versus poison are NOT useless if you happen to lack poison
resistance!

14) Likewise, cursed amulets of life saving are still amulets of live
saving

15) If you want to complain about the RNG, wait until you die a death
that actually isn't your fault

